  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Sometimes getting in instances of events, such as vrchat clubbing can be really frustrating because they're getting full really fast, and if you didn't get in on time you have to spam join attempts and depend on luck.\n\nCurrently, some of the clubs solve this by using VRCDN bots which allow to have Queue system, but it has it's downsides.\n\nHaving the queue system natively, at least for Friends/Friends+ instances would be very nice for this cause.",
